sequenceDiagram
  actor KA as 知识管理员
  participant GW as api-gateway
  participant KO as knowledge-orchestrator
  participant Celery as Celery
  participant MySQL as MySQL
  participant Milvus as Milvus

  KA->>GW: POST /knowledge/import (multipart)
  GW->>GW: 鉴权(knowledge_admin)
  GW->>KO: forward
  KO->>KO: 文件类型/MIME/大小/摘要校验
  KO->>MySQL: 保存原件(objectStore)
  KO->>MySQL: 写入入库任务(queued)
  KO->>Celery: 提交解析任务
  KO-->>GW: {jobId, status:"queued"}

  Note over KO,Celery: 异步处理
  Celery->>KO: 执行解析任务
  KO->>KO: 解析→分块（保留坐标+类型标记）
  KO->>KO: 后处理管道（关键词+标签+有效期提取）
  KO->>MySQL: 写入分块元数据
  KO->>Milvus: 写入向量索引
  KO->>MySQL: 任务→review_pending
  KO->>MySQL: 失败→failed→可重试(queued)

  KA->>GW: POST /knowledge/:id/publish
  KO->>MySQL: 版本状态 review_pending→published
